| `config_reads.roots` | list of strings | `["agents", "api", "demo", "evals", "mcp", "models", "runtimes", "scripts", "src"]` | a non-empty list of repo-relative directories, with no leading or trailing `/` | `tests/integration/test_config_reads_gate.py` (`reads_policy`, `direct_reads`) | Lists the code roots the gate test walks for a direct read of a file `scripts/config_loader.py` `PROJECT_READS` names, or of a variable the config declares; the loader itself is left out. An empty list, or a root with a leading or trailing `/`, fails the gate test, because a walk over nothing is no pass. | the direct test helpers: `config_reads.test_helpers_root`; fixture-building `conftest.py`, `test_*.py` and nested test modules are left out of that helper walk | always |
